From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:47:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] tests/wayland: Add test for text input cursor rectangles
 after focus moves

Check that a cursor rectangle reaches the input method after the
previously focused surface went away while it still had a cursor
rectangle update pending.
---
